# Who may use which topics. Topics are smartdoor/door/<door id>/<kind>.
# Doors can't publish commands, so a leaked door password can't open a door.
user backend
topic readwrite smartdoor/#

user door
topic read smartdoor/door/+/cmd
topic read smartdoor/door/+/access
topic write smartdoor/door/+/status
topic write smartdoor/door/+/report
topic write smartdoor/door/+/online
